WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:09.500
Find your way around
Manage learners, administrators and employers here. The summary cards filter the directory by role or active programme.

2
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:20.800
Search and filter
Search names, email addresses, groups or programmes. Open Filters, choose your criteria and select Apply filters. Clear all resets them.

3
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:28.400
Open and edit records
View opens the learner workspace or employer page. The pencil edits details. More actions contains additional options for that record.

4
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:36.800
Create and import users
Create user offers the supported user types. Upload learners opens the import process. Review the information before submitting.

5
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:46.722
Directory tools
Columns changes the visible fields. Export downloads the current results. Administrative tools include bulk actions and the form builders.
